※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4638

※ A container that never changes and holds only what is known while compiling
※ is made while compiling, into the image, as C++ makes a `static const` table
※ -- and the definition says so, so that a reader knows the table is not built
※ every time the line runs.

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let names: [str] = ["one", "two"]
    if #names = 2: 0u6 else: 1u6
